# viewport 1440x900
until 1200 ODDWATER
frames 12
expect ODDWATER
expect 7 shrimp
save remaster-tank
click Sound off
frames 8
save remaster-sound
click Feed
frames 8
expect Dinner is served
save remaster-fed
click Water change
frames 30
expect 30% water changed
save remaster-water
click Daylight
frames 6
save remaster-night
